<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/packaging#hasEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for membership and packaging metadata shared by archive and compound-resource descriptions. Use it as a predicate. Applicable SHACL paths and their focus-node scopes are listed below; no additional global domain is inferred from that usage."@en .
